=over

=item instance_id - unsigned integer. the instance ID to get the SDL_Haptic for.

=back

Returns SDL3::Haptic object or undef: an SDL_Haptic on success or NULL on failure or if it hasn't been opened yet; call SDL_GetError() for more information.

Since: This function is available since SDL 3.2.0.

